      "content": "i get that but the doctor only gave us a general idea of what to do and we're just waiting for a follow up appointment in like two weeks. he's so exhausted it's hard for him to even go to school. wouldn't a higher dose just fill his reserves up faster so he can get back to normal sooner? it just seems like logic if he's lacking it.",
